                                                "sense_id": "e9902073-71d7-3fcb-8eee-2950e4e146ce",
                                                "text": "As such compromises and syntheses suggest, it was not only hardline Paracelsans who embraced spagyric remedies."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8de9d589-448a-410e-a2ca-064e88915fc4",
                                                "sense_id": "e9902073-71d7-3fcb-8eee-2950e4e146ce",
                                                "text": "The necessary spagyric substances having been obtained, they were shut up in a glass phial and left to incubate in horse dung for forty days."
                                            }
